            "detailed_description": "<h1>NOTICE</h1><p>This is a re-release of a classic game. Even though it was tested on a variety of modern Windows PC configurations, unwanted side effects such as video/audio glitches and crashes may occur. If you are encountering technical issues with this game, please visit the community forums for assistance and support.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>At the height of World War 2, take command of German, Russian, British, American and Imperial Japanese armies on battelfields across the globe. Sudden Strike 2 expands on all aspects of the classic RTS game with new units, maps and epic campaigns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 epic campaigns and a new combat theater: The Pacific!<br></li><li>Massive battleships, landing craft and trains <br></li><li>Command airfields and deploy aircraft<br></li><li>Mechanized units now have individual crews to command<br></li><li>Dynamic weather system<br></li><li>Contains &quot;Sudden Strike 2&quot;, &quot;Resource War&quot; add-on and &quot;Total Victory&quot; map pack<br></li><li>Contains map editor for user-generated maps and missions</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "At the height of World War 2, take command of German, Russian, British, American and Imperial Japanese armies on battelfields across the globe. Sudden Strike 2 expands on all aspects of the classic RTS game with new units, maps and epic campaigns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 epic campaigns and a new combat theater: The Pacific!<br></li><li>Massive battleships, landing craft and trains <br></li><li>Command airfields and deploy aircraft<br></li><li>Mechanized units now have individual crews to command<br></li><li>Dynamic weather system<br></li><li>Contains &quot;Sudden Strike 2&quot;, &quot;Resource War&quot; add-on and &quot;Total Victory&quot; map pack<br></li><li>Contains map editor for user-generated maps and missions</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "At the height of World War 2, take command of German, Russian, British, American and Imperial Japanese armies on battelfields across the globe. Sudden Strike 2 expands on all aspects of the classic RTS game with new units, maps and epic campaigns.",
